      "text": "User types\n      │\n      ▼\nsetSearchQuery()\n      │\n      ▼\nReact schedules render\n      │\n      ▼\nComponent renders\n      │\n      ▼\nReact commits DOM updates\n      │\n      ▼\nRun previous cleanup\n(clearTimeout)\n      │\n      ▼\nRun new useEffect\n      │\n      ▼\nCreate new timer (2 seconds)\n      │\n      ▼\nUser types again?\n   │            │\n Yes            No\n │              │\n ▼              ▼\nCleanup     Timer finishes\n │              │\n ▼              ▼\nCancel timer  Browser queues callback\n                 │\n                 ▼\n           filterSearchResults()",
